<title>UK: Cogeneration sets $100 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Cogeneration sets $100 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE COGENERATION PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     2.5	 MATURITY    12.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE    CONVERTIBLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 PREMIUM    14.9 PCT  DENONS (K)  1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE FROM 12.FEB.00 - 11.FEB.01 AT 115.321</p>
<p>		CALLABLE FROM 12.FEB 01 - 11.FEB.02 AT 121.187</p>
<p>		3-YEAR NON-CALL, SUBJECT TO 140 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		PUT 12.FEB.02 AT 127.478</p>
<p>		CNV PRICE 112 BAHT PER SHARE, CLOSE 97.5 BAHTZ</p>
<p>		230.98 SHARES PER BOND, FOREX FIX $25.87/1 BAHT</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PERIOD - 01.JUL.97-31.JAN.07</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
